{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2023-02-17 08:30:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC RECEIVES CE MARK FOR EXTRAVASCULAR DEFIBRILLATOR SYSTEM THAT TREATS ABNORMAL HEART RHYTHMS', 'text': 'EV-ICD DEFIBRILLATION LEAD PLACED OUTSIDE OF HEART AND VEINS, PRESERVING VASCULATURE DUBLIN , FEB. 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT) HAS RECEIVED CE (CONFORMITÉ EUROPÉENNE) MARK FOR THE AURORA EV-ICD™ MRI SURESCAN™ (EXTRAVASCULAR IMPLANTABLE CARDIOVERTER-DEFIBRILLATOR) AND EPSILA EV™ MRI SURESCAN™ DEFIBRILLATION LEAD TO TREAT DANGEROUSLY FAST HEART RHYTHMS THAT CAN LEAD TO SUDDEN CARDIAC ARREST. THE AURORA EV-ICD SYSTEM PROVIDES THE LIFE-SAVING BENEFITS OF TRADITIONAL ICDS WHILE AVOIDING CERTAIN RISKS BECAUSE ITS LEAD (THIN WIRE) IS PLACED OUTSIDE THE HEART AND VEINS.'}